<title>SWEDEN: Swedish industrial production rises 4.0 pct Dec.</title>
<headline>Swedish industrial production rises 4.0 pct Dec.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial production rose 4.0 percent in December for a year-on-year rise of 10.7 percent, Statistics Sweden said on Thursday.</p>
<p> (Percentage change)  Dec 96    Nov 96     yr/yr</p>
<p>			    +4.0	  +3.1     +10.7</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
</text>
